title: Data sent to a Telegram bot
severity: critical
score: 80
tags: phishing, exfil-telegram
attack: T1567, T1102.002, T1056.003
description: The page called the Telegram Bot API from the browser
  (api.telegram.org/bot<token>/sendMessage or similar). Phishing kits use a Telegram bot as
  their drop.
---
requests
| where host == "api.telegram.org"
    and begins_with_match(path, list("exfiltration.telegram_bot"))
| project method, url = substring(url, 0, 300), has_body = isnotempty(post)
